  "WBTC/WETH LP positions accepted as collateral in the Bluechip spoke.":
    "Posisi LP WBTC/WETH diterima sebagai jaminan di spoke Bluechip.",
  "Pool onboarded": "Pool di-onboard",
  "Dual-oracle": "Dual-oracle",
  "WETH/DAI LP positions accepted as collateral in the Uniswap v2 spoke.":
    "Posisi LP WETH/DAI diterima sebagai jaminan di spoke Uniswap v2.",
  Onboarded: "Di-onboard",
  "Parameters refreshed": "Parameter disegarkan",
  "Full-range USDC/USDT liquidity accepted in the Stable spoke at up to 78% LTV.":
    "Likuiditas full-range USDC/USDT diterima di spoke Stable hingga LTV 78%.",
  "Stable spoke launch": "Peluncuran spoke Stable",
  "De-peg drill": "Latihan de-peg",
  "Risk council": "Dewan risiko",
  "Fee-split": "Pembagian biaya",
  "ETH/USDC 0.30% is the deepest Uniswap v3 pool by volume and functions as the benchmark pair for ETH price discovery. The Bluechip spoke accepts these LP positions as borrow collateral, which means this market sits at the intersection of deep trading liquidity, a stable quote asset, and a higher-risk volatile leg. The combination gives borrowers meaningful capacity while still keeping the underwriting rules conservative enough to absorb ETH drawdowns.":
    "ETH/USDC 0.30% adalah pool Uniswap v3 terdalam berdasarkan volume dan berfungsi sebagai pasangan patokan untuk penemuan harga ETH. Spoke Bluechip menerima posisi LP ini sebagai jaminan pinjaman, yang berarti pasar ini berada di persimpangan likuiditas perdagangan yang dalam, aset kuotasi yang stabil, dan kaki volatil berisiko lebih tinggi. Kombinasi ini memberi peminjam kapasitas yang berarti sambil tetap menjaga aturan penjaminan cukup konservatif untuk menyerap penurunan ETH.",
  "Uni v3 Bluechip added as collateral source.": "Uni v3 Bluechip ditambahkan sebagai sumber jaminan.",
  "Risk council bumped the ceiling from 65% to 70%.": "Dewan risiko menaikkan plafon dari 65% menjadi 70%.",
  "Switched from 60m to 30m TWAP.": "Beralih dari TWAP 60m ke 30m.",
  "30d realized σ ≈ 58% annualized — the single biggest contributor to impermanent loss.":
    "σ realisasi 30d ≈ 58% disetahunkan — kontributor tunggal terbesar terhadap impermanent loss.",
  "$4.1M of 2% depth across all tiers — ample for liquidations.":
    "Kedalaman 2% senilai $4.1M di seluruh tier — cukup untuk likuidasi.",
  "30-minute TWAP can lag during sharp moves; mitigated by kink in the risk curve.":
    "TWAP 30 menit dapat tertinggal saat pergerakan tajam; dimitigasi oleh kink pada kurva risiko.",
  "Uniswap v3 core + NonFungiblePositionManager, both heavily audited and live for 4 years.":
    "Uniswap v3 core + NonFungiblePositionManager, keduanya banyak diaudit dan aktif selama 4 tahun.",
  "Rolling 90d IL averages 23bps per week for the 0.30% tier.":
    "IL 90d bergulir rata-rata 23bps per minggu untuk tier 0.30%.",
  "WBTC/WETH is the dominant on-chain BTC↔ETH trading pair and one of the most familiar blue-chip routes in DeFi. The Bluechip spoke allows it as collateral with a conservative 67% LTV because bridged-BTC custody risk, even when well managed, still deserves a tighter margin than native ETH pairs. That keeps borrowing power useful without treating wrapped BTC like a pure base-asset market.":
    "WBTC/WETH adalah pasangan perdagangan BTC↔ETH on-chain yang dominan dan salah satu rute blue-chip paling dikenal di DeFi. Spoke Bluechip mengizinkannya sebagai jaminan dengan LTV konservatif 67% karena risiko kustodi bridged-BTC, bahkan ketika dikelola dengan baik, tetap layak mendapat margin yang lebih ketat daripada pasangan ETH native. Itu menjaga daya pinjam tetap berguna tanpa memperlakukan wrapped BTC seperti pasar aset dasar murni.",
  "WBTC/WETH added to the Bluechip spoke.": "WBTC/WETH ditambahkan ke spoke Bluechip.",
  "Added Chainlink feed alongside the TWAP for resilience.": "Menambahkan feed Chainlink bersama TWAP untuk ketahanan.",
  "30d realized σ ≈ 48% annualized.": "σ realisasi 30d ≈ 48% disetahunkan.",
  "WBTC depends on BitGo custody — reviewed monthly by the risk council.":
    "WBTC bergantung pada kustodi BitGo — ditinjau bulanan oleh dewan risiko.",
  "Chainlink feed + 30m TWAP with deviation guardrails.": "Feed Chainlink + TWAP 30m dengan pengaman deviasi.",
  "$2.6M of 2% depth.": "Kedalaman 2% senilai $2.6M.",
  "BTC/ETH is highly correlated — IL is usually <15bps/week.":
    "BTC/ETH sangat berkorelasi — IL biasanya <15bps/minggu.",
  "WETH/DAI is a standard Uniswap v2 ETH/stable pair and a straightforward LP structure for collateral evaluation. The Uniswap v2 spoke admits it under conservative parameters because the pair still carries ETH volatility, while the stable quote side keeps the market easy to reason about.":
    "WETH/DAI adalah pasangan ETH/stable Uniswap v2 standar dan struktur LP yang sederhana untuk evaluasi jaminan. Spoke Uniswap v2 mengakuinya di bawah parameter konservatif karena pasangan ini masih membawa volatilitas ETH, sementara sisi kuotasi stabil menjaga pasar mudah dipahami.",
  "Added to the Uniswap v2 LPs.": "Ditambahkan ke LP Uniswap v2.",
  "Quarterly risk review — no changes to LTV.": "Tinjauan risiko triwulanan — tidak ada perubahan pada LTV.",
  "USDC and USDT both trade at parity and the pool is overwhelmingly used for order-routing, stability-seeking flow, and tight-spread execution. The Stable spoke admits it with a high LTV because peg-risk is shared, depth is enormous, and the pool behaves more like cash infrastructure than a typical volatile LP. That makes it a natural fit for users who want borrowing power while keeping the underlying collateral profile simple to reason about.":
    "USDC dan USDT keduanya diperdagangkan pada paritas dan pool ini secara luar biasa digunakan untuk order-routing, aliran pencari stabilitas, dan eksekusi spread ketat. Spoke Stable mengakuinya dengan LTV tinggi karena risiko peg bersama, kedalaman sangat besar, dan pool berperilaku lebih seperti infrastruktur tunai daripada LP volatil biasa. Itu menjadikannya cocok secara alami bagi pengguna yang menginginkan daya pinjam sambil menjaga profil jaminan yang mendasari tetap sederhana untuk dipahami.",
  "USDC/USDT included from day 1.": "USDC/USDT disertakan sejak hari 1.",
  "Circuit-breaker simulated during USDC March 2023 re-run — no forced liquidations.":
    "Circuit-breaker disimulasikan selama pengulangan USDC Maret 2023 — tidak ada likuidasi paksa.",
  "Guardrails pause new borrows if the Chainlink feed deviates >50bps for 5m.":
    "Pengaman menjeda pinjaman baru jika feed Chainlink menyimpang >50bps selama 5m.",
  "Circle + Tether attestations ingested weekly.": "Atestasi Circle + Tether dimasukkan setiap minggu.",
  "$18M of 2% depth.": "Kedalaman 2% senilai $18M.",
  "Uniswap v3 + LP NFT only.": "Uniswap v3 + LP NFT saja.",
  "Correlated assets → IL near zero in normal conditions.": "Aset berkorelasi → IL mendekati nol dalam kondisi normal.",
  "ETH/USDC on Uniswap v3 is deep and battle-tested but exposes LPs to ETH volatility. Risk is dominated by impermanent loss and, to a lesser degree, oracle latency during fast moves.":
    "ETH/USDC di Uniswap v3 dalam dan teruji tempur tetapi mengekspos LP terhadap volatilitas ETH. Risiko didominasi oleh impermanent loss dan, pada tingkat lebih rendah, latensi oracle saat pergerakan cepat.",
  "WBTC carries BitGo custody risk on top of BTC volatility. The pair's depth is comfortable and the dual-oracle setup mitigates single-feed failure modes.":
    "WBTC membawa risiko kustodi BitGo di atas volatilitas BTC. Kedalaman pasangan ini nyaman dan pengaturan dual-oracle memitigasi mode kegagalan feed tunggal.",
  "Peg-to-peg correlation keeps impermanent loss negligible. The only tail scenarios involve a USDC or USDT de-peg; both are paused automatically by our oracle deviation guard.":
    "Korelasi peg-ke-peg menjaga impermanent loss dapat diabaikan. Satu-satunya skenario ekor melibatkan de-peg USDC atau USDT; keduanya dijeda otomatis oleh penjaga deviasi oracle kami.",
  "Quarterly risk review touches every active pool.": "Tinjauan risiko triwulanan menyentuh setiap pool aktif.",
  "90% of swap fees flow to suppliers, 10% to the protocol treasury.":
    "90% biaya swap mengalir ke penyedia, 10% ke perbendaharaan protokol.",
